{"path":"/about","rootClass":"container mx-auto px-6 py-16 max-w-4xl","breadcrumb":null,"children":[{"t":"a","c":"text-sm text-primary hover:underline mb-6 inline-block","x":"← Back to Home"},{"t":"div","c":"mb-16","h":"<h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">We're building the future of <span class=\"text-gradient-hero\">visitor intelligence.</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Pixelco is the first and only platform that lets websites identify anonymous visitors by their email address — not just their company. We're turning unknown traffic into real, actionable leads for businesses worldwide.</p>"},{"t":"section","c":"mb-16","h":"<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Our Mission</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-base\">97% of website visitors leave without ever filling out a form. That's thousands of potential customers, gone forever. We started Pixelco to solve this problem — to give every business, from startups to enterprises, the ability to know exactly who's visiting their site and reach out before the opportunity disappears.</p>"},{"t":"section","c":"mb-16","h":"<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6\">What We Stand For</h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5\"><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">Innovation First</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We built the world's first email-level visitor identification — because IP lookups weren't good enough.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">Privacy by Design</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our technology is 100% cookieless. We respect user privacy while delivering actionable insights.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">Global Scale</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We serve businesses in 50+ countries, identifying visitors across every continent.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">Results-Driven</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Every feature we ship is measured by one metric: does it help our customers convert more leads?</p></div></div>"},{"t":"section","c":"mb-16","h":"<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center py-10 border border-border rounded-xl bg-card shadow-card\"><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gradient-hero\">50+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Countries Served</p></div><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gradient-hero\">10M+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Visitors Identified</p></div><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gradient-hero\">2,000+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Businesses Trust Us</p></div></div>"},{"t":"section","c":"mb-16","h":"<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Our Team</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">We're a lean, global team of engineers, data scientists, and growth experts obsessed with turning anonymous traffic into revenue. Based everywhere, building for everyone.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">We're hiring! Interested in joining us? Reach out at <a href=\"mailto:support@pixelco.io\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">support@pixelco.io</a></p></div>"},{"t":"div","c":"text-center py-10 border-t border-border","h":"<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Ready to see who's visiting your site?</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground mb-6\">Start identifying anonymous visitors today — it's free.</p><a href=\"https://app.pixelco.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 gradient-cta text-primary-foreground border-0 hover:opacity-90 font-semibold px-8 py-3 text-base\">Get Started Free</button></a>"}]}